msgid "onboarding.consent.how_text"
msgstr ""
"1. Fill in your profile: interests, city, goal.\n"
"2. Browse people nearby with shared interests.\n"
"3. Like them. If the like is mutual, you both get each other's username and can chat."

msgid "onboarding.consent.text"
msgstr ""
"Hi! I help you find people with shared interests: friends, company, partners. This is not a "
"dating site. Shall we fill in your profile in 2 minutes?\n"
"\n"
"❗ The bot never asks for documents or personal data. People online may pretend to be someone "
"else.\n"
"\n"
"By continuing you accept the rules and the privacy policy."

